id: 18
hanzi: 位于
pinyin: wèi yú
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to be located at / in; to lie; to be situated in
  es: situarse en; ubicarse en; hallarse en; encontrarse en

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to occupy a specific geographical position or physical location | ocupar una posición geográfica determinada o hallarse emplazado en un lugar | 位于市中心 (located in the city center)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 这座闻名遐迩的历史文化名城位于长江下游平原，水网密布气候温和，自古就是鱼米之乡。 | Zhè zuò wénmíng-xiá'ěr de lìshǐ wénhuà míngchéng wèiyú Chángjiāng xiàyóu píngyuán, shuǐwǎng mìbù qìhòu wēnhé, zìgǔ jiùshì yúmǐ-zhīxiāng. | This famous historical city is located on the lower Yangtze plain; interlaced with canals and mild, it has been a land of fish and rice since antiquity. | Esta célebre urbe histórica se ubica en la llanura del curso bajo del Yangtsé; con clima templado y ríos, ha sido desde siempre emporio de arroz.
  #2 | 鲁迅在北京长期居住的故居位于阜成门内宫门口二条，如今已被改建为国家级鲁迅博物馆。 | Lǔ Xùn zài Běijīng chángqī jūzhù de gùjū wèiyú Fùchéngmén nèi Gōngménkǒu èrtiáo, rújīn yǐ bèi gǎijiàn wéi guójiājí Lǔ Xùn Bówùguǎn. | Lu Xun's long-term former residence in Beijing is located at Fuchengmen; today it has been renovated into the national Lu Xun Museum. | La antigua morada de Lu Xun en Pekín se ubica en el callejón Gongmenkou de Fuchengmen; hoy ha sido convertida en Museo Nacional Lu Xun.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
